(4353252, 627021, 88010, '<td valign="top">And I hope it stays in it''s place. Good colors but I wish I could see a little detail in the stove.</td>', 'And I hope it stays in it''s place. Good colors but I wish I could see a little detail in the stove.', '2008-01-02 09:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
