(4359556, 628107, 18207, '<td valign="top">Wow, a good moment to take a shot and a sad moment to witness. I like the horizontally divided composition.<br/>The light rays on the left end in a strange way. Is there a shadow there or it is the effect of post-processing?</td>', 'Wow, a good moment to take a shot and a sad moment to witness. I like the horizontally divided composition.The light rays on the left end in a strange way. Is there a shadow there or it is the effect of post-processing?', '2008-01-04 05:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359557, 628081, 18207, '<td valign="top">I like to look at smoke shots and this is a nice example. I''m not sure about the flame itself, it draws attention from the smoke and lowers the general quality of the image. Being this a fire challenge, I have to cut a point or two because of that.</td>', 'I like to look at smoke shots and this is a nice example. I''m not sure about the flame itself, it draws attention from the smoke and lowers the general quality of the image. Being this a fire challenge, I have to cut a point or two because of that.', '2008-01-04 05:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359559, 628326, 18207, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes but I would like to see it a bit lighter.</td>', 'Nice shapes but I would like to see it a bit lighter.', '2008-01-04 05:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359563, 627238, 18207, '<td valign="top">Another dim light soure would have lowered the contrast here, giving more room to play during post-process. That on the technical line. The real strength of this image is the idea and here your post excels.</td>', 'Another dim light soure would have lowered the contrast here, giving more room to play during post-process. That on the technical line. The real strength of this image is the idea and here your post excels.', '2008-01-04 05:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
