(4359579, 628038, 18207, '<td valign="top">Great idea, pleasant implementation, and a thoughtful title. Very well done.</td>', 'Great idea, pleasant implementation, and a thoughtful title. Very well done.', '2008-01-04 05:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359581, 626626, 18207, '<td valign="top">I like this shape (and the title that emphasizes it), I wonder how you could achieve this.</td>', 'I like this shape (and the title that emphasizes it), I wonder how you could achieve this.', '2008-01-04 05:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359588, 627061, 18207, '<td valign="top">People tend to vote high on good images even when the photo can hardly connected to the challenge. So I try to vote on the photo itself and then vote that result minus one for the wrong challenge. I''m trying hard but can''t find it interesting to see yet another almost centered sunset shot. Sorry for being rude. Can''t vote higher than 3.</td>', 'People tend to vote high on good images even when the photo can hardly connected to the challenge. So I try to vote on the photo itself and then vote that result minus one for the wrong challenge. I''m trying hard but can''t find it interesting to see yet another almost centered sunset shot. Sorry for being rude. Can''t vote higher than 3.', '2008-01-04 05:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359589, 628207, 18207, '<td valign="top">Idea, plan, execution. All well done. Rotating the image to landscape is clever.</td>', 'Idea, plan, execution. All well done. Rotating the image to landscape is clever.', '2008-01-04 05:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359590, 626552, 18207, '<td valign="top">Good composition and colors for a new take on the theme.</td>', 'Good composition and colors for a new take on the theme.', '2008-01-04 05:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359667, 628293, 18207, '<td valign="top">The idea deserves better execution. This lacks sharpness on the rocks very much. That sharpness would be in interesting contrast with the pattern drawn on the waving surface of water with light.</td>', 'The idea deserves better execution. This lacks sharpness on the rocks very much. That sharpness would be in interesting contrast with the pattern drawn on the waving surface of water with light.', '2008-01-04 07:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359671, 628447, 18207, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s yet another dull sunset in centered composition, loosely chained to the challenge by the title, no high vote from me.</td>', 'Well, it''s yet another dull sunset in centered composition, loosely chained to the challenge by the title, no high vote from me.', '2008-01-04 07:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359674, 628337, 18207, '<td valign="top">I think many will ask if it''s composed from several shots, I''ll come back and check the answer and vote for it as a single expo picture. The explosions are pretty, the car is composed well to strenghten the uneasy feeling, but the result still misses something, maybe a dramatic touch in PP.</td>', 'I think many will ask if it''s composed from several shots, I''ll come back and check the answer and vote for it as a single expo picture. The explosions are pretty, the car is composed well to strenghten the uneasy feeling, but the result still misses something, maybe a dramatic touch in PP.', '2008-01-04 07:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359699, 628198, 18207, '<td valign="top">The quality of the lighting is so good, the quantity is another question. Maybe with a little less light on the background the flame would pop out more and that would add a lot.</td>', 'The quality of the lighting is so good, the quantity is another question. Maybe with a little less light on the background the flame would pop out more and that would add a lot.', '2008-01-04 08:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359701, 626722, 18207, '<td valign="top">Well, well, well. A brave "as is" composition and lighting. I''m afraid it''s not as strong as it would be with another PoV.</td>', 'Well, well, well. A brave "as is" composition and lighting. I''m afraid it''s not as strong as it would be with another PoV.', '2008-01-04 08:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359705, 625871, 18207, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the check table but the way the fire lights the "fire water" is beautyful, just like the patters drawn by the same effect.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the check table but the way the fire lights the "fire water" is beautyful, just like the patters drawn by the same effect.', '2008-01-04 08:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
