(4359712, 628365, 18207, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many shots it took to actually find the shape you wanted. On the second thought, how many tries before you found a proper material to burn to get this beautifully structured flame. Good work.</td>', 'I wonder how many shots it took to actually find the shape you wanted. On the second thought, how many tries before you found a proper material to burn to get this beautifully structured flame. Good work.', '2008-01-04 08:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
