(4359720, 628255, 18207, '<td valign="top">Wear black clothes next time. ;-)<br/>I like the pun, well done.</td>', 'Wear black clothes next time. ;-)I like the pun, well done.', '2008-01-04 08:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359722, 627827, 18207, '<td valign="top">A documentary shot of heroes. As that, it''s a good one. But challenges and daily work are different. Or supposed to be.</td>', 'A documentary shot of heroes. As that, it''s a good one. But challenges and daily work are different. Or supposed to be.', '2008-01-04 08:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359723, 627338, 18207, '<td valign="top">I like what I see so much that I want to see more. I mean I miss some room, mostly on the top. The texture of the wood and the structure of the flames is hust perfect.</td>', 'I like what I see so much that I want to see more. I mean I miss some room, mostly on the top. The texture of the wood and the structure of the flames is hust perfect.', '2008-01-04 08:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359727, 628022, 18207, '<td valign="top">I miss something extra here. Everyone makes some sparkler shots or some hundred, yours should be different somehow.</td>', 'I miss something extra here. Everyone makes some sparkler shots or some hundred, yours should be different somehow.', '2008-01-04 08:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359731, 626025, 18207, '<td valign="top">In this case, the direct composition works well. I like it.</td>', 'In this case, the direct composition works well. I like it.', '2008-01-04 08:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359739, 627950, 18207, '<td valign="top">Apart from the title (that suggests that fire is good for a firefighter) I like your interpretation of the theme and I like the way you show the time passing. Thank you for not using the cheap effect of selective desaturation. ;-)<br/>Nutpicking mode on - there are rotation leftovers on the left and bottom which should have been cut.</td>', 'Apart from the title (that suggests that fire is good for a firefighter) I like your interpretation of the theme and I like the way you show the time passing. Thank you for not using the cheap effect of selective desaturation. ;-)Nutpicking mode on - there are rotation leftovers on the left and bottom which should have been cut.', '2008-01-04 08:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359749, 626570, 18207, '<td valign="top">I like that you included the entire flame and the amazing play of light and shadows on the ornament. Very moody.</td>', 'I like that you included the entire flame and the amazing play of light and shadows on the ornament. Very moody.', '2008-01-04 08:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359752, 628037, 18207, '<td valign="top">Well composed and strong shot, that bit of halo at the left of the man is not that distracting.</td>', 'Well composed and strong shot, that bit of halo at the left of the man is not that distracting.', '2008-01-04 08:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359754, 626250, 18207, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.</td>', 'Simple and effective.', '2008-01-04 08:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359755, 627938, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s really creepy...in a cool way! I''m fascinated by the figure on the right that seems to be sneaking away from the log. BTW, how close to the cemetery was this wood cut? ;-)</td>', 'Wow! That''s really creepy...in a cool way! I''m fascinated by the figure on the right that seems to be sneaking away from the log. BTW, how close to the cemetery was this wood cut? ;-)', '2008-01-04 08:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
