(4359760, 626977, 18207, '<td valign="top">It took some time to see what I''m looking at but I can feel the heat and that''s something. I''m not sure about cutting the flame on the left, though.</td>', 'It took some time to see what I''m looking at but I can feel the heat and that''s something. I''m not sure about cutting the flame on the left, though.', '2008-01-04 08:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359763, 628235, 18207, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and good presentation, well done.</td>', 'Interesting idea and good presentation, well done.', '2008-01-04 08:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359767, 628098, 18207, '<td valign="top">A little bit too close for me, miss some more room around and maybe some more details in "gold".</td>', 'A little bit too close for me, miss some more room around and maybe some more details in "gold".', '2008-01-04 08:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359773, 628147, 18207, '<td valign="top">I can feel the heat but I miss some definition here and don''t understand the necessity of the black framing.</td>', 'I can feel the heat but I miss some definition here and don''t understand the necessity of the black framing.', '2008-01-04 08:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359776, 628288, 18207, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!</td>', 'Very nicely done!', '2008-01-04 08:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359781, 628454, 81382, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something shape in an image to complement the blurryness of the fire element - so many other entries are just low lit blurred efforts. There is quite a strong yellow colour cast on the entire image other than the flame itself which is actually quite effective.</td>', 'Nice to see something shape in an image to complement the blurryness of the fire element - so many other entries are just low lit blurred efforts. There is quite a strong yellow colour cast on the entire image other than the flame itself which is actually quite effective.', '2008-01-04 08:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359790, 626746, 81382, '<td valign="top">The distracting glow near the top right hand corner is ... well... distracting. If only it wasn''t there as the rest of the image is quite different from a lot of other entries and is very well composed and has nice DOF. The fire element is subtle and with the colour cast complements the other subjects.</td>', 'The distracting glow near the top right hand corner is ... well... distracting. If only it wasn''t there as the rest of the image is quite different from a lot of other entries and is very well composed and has nice DOF. The fire element is subtle and with the colour cast complements the other subjects.', '2008-01-04 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359792, 627880, 18207, '<td valign="top">With some post-processing it would be much better. I mean primarily to get rid of the noise and the gray layer.</td>', 'With some post-processing it would be much better. I mean primarily to get rid of the noise and the gray layer.', '2008-01-04 08:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359794, 626084, 81382, '<td valign="top">Just lacking a sharp focal point to offset the blurryness of the flames.</td>', 'Just lacking a sharp focal point to offset the blurryness of the flames.', '2008-01-04 08:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359803, 626065, 81382, '<td valign="top">Just lacking a sharp focal point for me. Interesting patterns but is let down by the composition. Perhaps a much tighter crop around the sharpest area would have created a bold abstract.</td>', 'Just lacking a sharp focal point for me. Interesting patterns but is let down by the composition. Perhaps a much tighter crop around the sharpest area would have created a bold abstract.', '2008-01-04 08:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359820, 628338, 81382, '<td valign="top">Let down by the background and clothing, both of which take the eye away from the flames. For instance, plain black clothes would have said to me "the choice of clothing has been considered and was a deliberate attempt at keeping the shot simple" whereas this is saying "its what the model happened to have on at the time" and doesn''t complement the image or concept</td>', 'Let down by the background and clothing, both of which take the eye away from the flames. For instance, plain black clothes would have said to me "the choice of clothing has been considered and was a deliberate attempt at keeping the shot simple" whereas this is saying "its what the model happened to have on at the time" and doesn''t complement the image or concept', '2008-01-04 08:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359825, 628386, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely complementary colours going on. Well composed (position of the sun a third in from the right) but could have done with moving the horizon down a touch to follow suit. Good foreground detail but might have been worth taking the shot from ground level to increase the effect.</td>', 'Lovely complementary colours going on. Well composed (position of the sun a third in from the right) but could have done with moving the horizon down a touch to follow suit. Good foreground detail but might have been worth taking the shot from ground level to increase the effect.', '2008-01-04 08:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359833, 627421, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well composed. The tree line could be a little sharper but this might just be because of the resize. Perhaps increasing the purple saturation in the sky to complement the yellow hues might have been worth considering</td>', 'Well composed. The tree line could be a little sharper but this might just be because of the resize. Perhaps increasing the purple saturation in the sky to complement the yellow hues might have been worth considering', '2008-01-04 08:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359835, 628222, 81382, '<td valign="top">No points for originality but well executed.</td>', 'No points for originality but well executed.', '2008-01-04 08:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4359847, 628316, 81382, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit strange, the thin band of what appears to be ground at the bottom might have been better if it was a third up from the bottom of the frame. Also could have done with a ccw rotation to square up the horizon. Lovely colours though</td>', 'Composition is a bit strange, the thin band of what appears to be ground at the bottom might have been better if it was a third up from the bottom of the frame. Also could have done with a ccw rotation to square up the horizon. Lovely colours though', '2008-01-04 09:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4360124, 628365, 86799, '<td valign="top">YES!  A flame that''s not just a flame or a match or a burning log.  Good catch.</td>', 'YES!  A flame that''s not just a flame or a match or a burning log.  Good catch.', '2008-01-04 11:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4360136, 627103, 86799, '<td valign="top">Most of the drama and interest is right on the valve itself.  The heat and fury could be accentuated by a tighter crop, IMO.  Just a thought.  Nice, though, good work.  Out of the ordinary.</td>', 'Most of the drama and interest is right on the valve itself.  The heat and fury could be accentuated by a tighter crop, IMO.  Just a thought.  Nice, though, good work.  Out of the ordinary.', '2008-01-04 11:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4360138, 628207, 86799, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.</td>', 'Interesting idea.', '2008-01-04 11:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4360146, 627352, 86799, '<td valign="top">I like the flaming sword, but not sure a pretty girl assasin and shiny leaves go with the concept very well.  Seems to dampen the drama.</td>', 'I like the flaming sword, but not sure a pretty girl assasin and shiny leaves go with the concept very well.  Seems to dampen the drama.', '2008-01-04 11:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
