(4363578, 627021, 33446, '<td valign="top">i like the mirror image of the fire in the door</td>', 'i like the mirror image of the fire in the door', '2008-01-05 15:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363581, 628396, 33446, '<td valign="top">i had to look hard to see the mushroom but it''s an unique photo</td>', 'i had to look hard to see the mushroom but it''s an unique photo', '2008-01-05 15:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363614, 627456, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. Good to see something a bit OOTB but still attractive and non-pretentious. Great spread of colour.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. Good to see something a bit OOTB but still attractive and non-pretentious. Great spread of colour.', '2008-01-05 15:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363621, 626420, 3746, '<td valign="top">Now I really like this shot. Without trying to sound a bit art-critic pretentious, you can actually feel the heat from this one. The focus on the wood in the foreground is spot on, and the DOF works well. well done.</td>', 'Now I really like this shot. Without trying to sound a bit art-critic pretentious, you can actually feel the heat from this one. The focus on the wood in the foreground is spot on, and the DOF works well. well done.', '2008-01-05 15:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363624, 626696, 3746, '<td valign="top">It feels like you have upped the saturations a bit too much and the red content in the skin tones has also been enhanced making the flesh tones a bit too red. overall a nice shot though.</td>', 'It feels like you have upped the saturations a bit too much and the red content in the skin tones has also been enhanced making the flesh tones a bit too red. overall a nice shot though.', '2008-01-05 15:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363628, 627761, 3746, '<td valign="top">Dull, boring and uninspired. Sorry but this shot is one of loads that indeed meets the challenge, but does nothing else to inspire the viewer.</td>', 'Dull, boring and uninspired. Sorry but this shot is one of loads that indeed meets the challenge, but does nothing else to inspire the viewer.', '2008-01-05 15:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363637, 628181, 3746, '<td valign="top">Trying to capture a flame whilst also trying to expose correctly for a subject lit by the same flame is a nightmare situation, the exposure here favours the model, thus blowing out any detail in the flame (which, apart from the small amount of blue at the base, looks like a white blob to me). However, the focus on the models eye is bang on, the colour is well controlled and the DOF is to die for.. a pretty good study that was always going to be tricky to expose for.<br/>Good luck  (either Mak or Hanae).</td>', 'Trying to capture a flame whilst also trying to expose correctly for a subject lit by the same flame is a nightmare situation, the exposure here favours the model, thus blowing out any detail in the flame (which, apart from the small amount of blue at the base, looks like a white blob to me). However, the focus on the models eye is bang on, the colour is well controlled and the DOF is to die for.. a pretty good study that was always going to be tricky to expose for.Good luck  (either Mak or Hanae).', '2008-01-05 15:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363641, 628343, 3746, '<td valign="top">Dull * boring I am afraid. Even using the full 640x640 pixels wouldnt of saved this image. Its seems to be there just to enter something in the challenge.</td>', 'Dull * boring I am afraid. Even using the full 640x640 pixels wouldnt of saved this image. Its seems to be there just to enter something in the challenge.', '2008-01-05 15:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363644, 628441, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the colors that came out in this. Except for a slight skew, this is good.</td>', 'Love the colors that came out in this. Except for a slight skew, this is good.', '2008-01-05 15:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363648, 625871, 3746, '<td valign="top">This seems like a genuine "Whiterook" to me.</td>', 'This seems like a genuine "Whiterook" to me.', '2008-01-05 15:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363650, 628145, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, I actually like how this one fits in the challenge. Granted I feel a wee bit of shoehorning with that title, but I don''t care in this case... I bet if you could post-process this a bit more it would be a stunning image. Good effort..</td>', 'OK, I actually like how this one fits in the challenge. Granted I feel a wee bit of shoehorning with that title, but I don''t care in this case... I bet if you could post-process this a bit more it would be a stunning image. Good effort..', '2008-01-05 15:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363652, 627357, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is pretty blurry and dim. Looks like they may have been moving as well. It''s hard to tell. Try using a tripod and a slow shutter speed, that ought to be able to get a clear image of the candles and the flam will have a soft glow.</td>', 'I''m afraid this is pretty blurry and dim. Looks like they may have been moving as well. It''s hard to tell. Try using a tripod and a slow shutter speed, that ought to be able to get a clear image of the candles and the flam will have a soft glow.', '2008-01-05 15:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363656, 626402, 3746, '<td valign="top">The heat-distortion here steals the shot for me, which is a good thing, it made my eye wander around the shot and study it in a bit more detail.  So anything that grabs the viewers attention and demands a closer look is an achievement in itself. Well done.</td>', 'The heat-distortion here steals the shot for me, which is a good thing, it made my eye wander around the shot and study it in a bit more detail.  So anything that grabs the viewers attention and demands a closer look is an achievement in itself. Well done.', '2008-01-05 15:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363660, 626405, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, the colors fit the theme of fire, but unless those low clouds are from a forest fire, I think it''s a shoehorn entry. It''s a nice enough sunrise, but it does not really stand out from a lot of similar shots. Sorry if that all sounds kinda harsh.</td>', 'Well, the colors fit the theme of fire, but unless those low clouds are from a forest fire, I think it''s a shoehorn entry. It''s a nice enough sunrise, but it does not really stand out from a lot of similar shots. Sorry if that all sounds kinda harsh.', '2008-01-05 15:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363662, 626025, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like an alien spaceship.</td>', 'Looks like an alien spaceship.', '2008-01-05 15:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363670, 626084, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good comp, but it''s lacking a little of the evasive "pow" factor. Maybe if there was some more detail showing in the burning wood. I''m not sure exactly what it is.</td>', 'Good comp, but it''s lacking a little of the evasive "pow" factor. Maybe if there was some more detail showing in the burning wood. I''m not sure exactly what it is.', '2008-01-05 15:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363678, 626730, 83313, '<td valign="top">A lot of high ISO noise, which to be fair, is going to be a problem with a lot of entries for this challenge. The candle on the right is cut off a bit and that does not help it, I''m afraid.</td>', 'A lot of high ISO noise, which to be fair, is going to be a problem with a lot of entries for this challenge. The candle on the right is cut off a bit and that does not help it, I''m afraid.', '2008-01-05 16:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363682, 628082, 83313, '<td valign="top">The DOF does not quite cover the diameter of the candle, but you captured the flame wonderfully. I like the bit of orange halo.</td>', 'The DOF does not quite cover the diameter of the candle, but you captured the flame wonderfully. I like the bit of orange halo.', '2008-01-05 16:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363687, 626829, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like an effort to save a snapshot with lots of camera shake.</td>', 'Looks like an effort to save a snapshot with lots of camera shake.', '2008-01-05 16:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363694, 627103, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. The composition reminds me a little of the old Maxell ads from the ''80s.</td>', 'Nice. The composition reminds me a little of the old Maxell ads from the ''80s.', '2008-01-05 16:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363698, 628084, 83313, '<td valign="top">I feel this one is a shoehorn. Fire does create warmth, but warmth was not the theme. It is a nice zoomblur, however. I like the bold curlicue''s of color.</td>', 'I feel this one is a shoehorn. Fire does create warmth, but warmth was not the theme. It is a nice zoomblur, however. I like the bold curlicue''s of color.', '2008-01-05 16:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363707, 627251, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pushing the boundaries of the theme a bit, but I can see a fiery redhead with an icy stare. Great portrait.</td>', 'Pushing the boundaries of the theme a bit, but I can see a fiery redhead with an icy stare. Great portrait.', '2008-01-05 16:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363711, 626920, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love the expression, at least what part of it is visible.</td>', 'I love the expression, at least what part of it is visible.', '2008-01-05 16:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363716, 627421, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not really fire here. It is a really nice shot though. It''s hard to get a unique sunrise or sunset and you did get that.</td>', 'Not really fire here. It is a really nice shot though. It''s hard to get a unique sunrise or sunset and you did get that.', '2008-01-05 16:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363730, 628181, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is nice. There''s some story to this perhaps? A lot of sweat or glare visible on her face is a distraction for me and changes the mood of the image. Without sweat/glare: quite contemplation.<br/>With sweat/glare: fear and anxiety.</td>', 'This is nice. There''s some story to this perhaps? A lot of sweat or glare visible on her face is a distraction for me and changes the mood of the image. Without sweat/glare: quite contemplation.With sweat/glare: fear and anxiety.', '2008-01-05 16:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363757, 628451, 3746, '<td valign="top">Great shot, you have captured the intensity and the fury of the firehere, My pick for top 5.</td>', 'Great shot, you have captured the intensity and the fury of the firehere, My pick for top 5.', '2008-01-05 16:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4363810, 626977, 79153, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I love the sharpness of the wood.</td>', 'Very nice, I love the sharpness of the wood.', '2008-01-05 17:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
