(4372271, 627103, 88706, '<td valign="top">Just to be nit picky, but the subject should either be dead center, or obviously off center (2/3 or so).  It looks like its meant for dead center, but is noticeably off, and not in a good way.  Other than that, i really like the image.</td>', 'Just to be nit picky, but the subject should either be dead center, or obviously off center (2/3 or so).  It looks like its meant for dead center, but is noticeably off, and not in a good way.  Other than that, i really like the image.', '2008-01-07 23:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
