(4372450, 628337, 87968, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! This was at some show at Disney World, right? I wasn''t able to get anything like this when I saw it. I think you could have left a bit more of the bottom of the picture in (especially the bottom left) to make the car and flames more the center of attention.</td>', 'Nice capture! This was at some show at Disney World, right? I wasn''t able to get anything like this when I saw it. I think you could have left a bit more of the bottom of the picture in (especially the bottom left) to make the car and flames more the center of attention.', '2008-01-07 23:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4372700, 626250, 74371, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2008-01-08 00:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4372730, 628281, 74371, '<td valign="top">Photo is well done, but I would have liked the crop to have been larger...where it shows the top of the flames. With this close cropping I feel it lost some of it''s punch. (5)</td>', 'Photo is well done, but I would have liked the crop to have been larger...where it shows the top of the flames. With this close cropping I feel it lost some of it''s punch. (5)', '2008-01-08 01:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4372745, 628107, 74371, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot but a bit washed out. With some contrast, not only would the building in flames have been more in evidence, but the fire would have shown the intensity more.<br/> <br/>But, it is an awesome shot. (8)</td>', 'Wonderful shot but a bit washed out. With some contrast, not only would the building in flames have been more in evidence, but the fire would have shown the intensity more. But, it is an awesome shot. (8)', '2008-01-08 01:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4372756, 628288, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well defined. Crisp and clear. I like the smoke seeming to come off the jalapeño when we know the pepper is hotter than the flame!! :) (8)</td>', 'Nice shot, well defined. Crisp and clear. I like the smoke seeming to come off the jalapeño when we know the pepper is hotter than the flame!! :) (8)', '2008-01-08 01:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
