(4372776, 627928, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph! And this is a case of the title adding to the shot. It created a warmer feeling while looking at it! Good job all around!! (8)</td>', 'Nice photograph! And this is a case of the title adding to the shot. It created a warmer feeling while looking at it! Good job all around!! (8)', '2008-01-08 01:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
