(4374168, 626065, 70689, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know what to think of this one. The ''flowers'' are clearly moving during the long exposure. I guess it''s intentional, but I don''t see why. The title doesn''t help me either. Somehow I think there was a good idea behind this picture, but I am afraid it''s so blurry that I fail to recognize the idea.</td>', 'I really don''t know what to think of this one. The ''flowers'' are clearly moving during the long exposure. I guess it''s intentional, but I don''t see why. The title doesn''t help me either. Somehow I think there was a good idea behind this picture, but I am afraid it''s so blurry that I fail to recognize the idea.', '2008-01-08 13:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374188, 627119, 23433, '<td valign="top">Fire in the sky.</td>', 'Fire in the sky.', '2008-01-08 13:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374398, 627352, 88004, '<td valign="top">Would have been scored higher if cropped more from left side. Subject is too centered. Wouldn''t take much off, just a bit from left side. Hot spots on face are distracting. Love the flare at the base of the sword.</td>', 'Would have been scored higher if cropped more from left side. Subject is too centered. Wouldn''t take much off, just a bit from left side. Hot spots on face are distracting. Love the flare at the base of the sword.', '2008-01-08 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374403, 628145, 88004, '<td valign="top">I assume the horse''s name is Fire. Would be a stronger image with the subject off center. Open up more to the right and allow ''somewhere for the horse to go''. Would love to see this image with an ''Orton'' effect (But the rules didn''t allow it). Great capture!</td>', 'I assume the horse''s name is Fire. Would be a stronger image with the subject off center. Open up more to the right and allow ''somewhere for the horse to go''. Would love to see this image with an ''Orton'' effect (But the rules didn''t allow it). Great capture!', '2008-01-08 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374405, 627338, 88004, '<td valign="top">Very tight crop. Hard to determine main subject.</td>', 'Very tight crop. Hard to determine main subject.', '2008-01-08 15:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374410, 628047, 88004, '<td valign="top">Nice photojournalism. Seems quite grainy. Exposure seems off.</td>', 'Nice photojournalism. Seems quite grainy. Exposure seems off.', '2008-01-08 15:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374413, 628245, 88004, '<td valign="top">Excellent photojournalism! Was it intentional fire or accident? I love it!</td>', 'Excellent photojournalism! Was it intentional fire or accident? I love it!', '2008-01-08 15:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374419, 628037, 88004, '<td valign="top">Excellent photojournalism! Not sure if the fire was intentional but I feel for the poor farmer whose hard work is burning away! I really love the emotion in the image!</td>', 'Excellent photojournalism! Not sure if the fire was intentional but I feel for the poor farmer whose hard work is burning away! I really love the emotion in the image!', '2008-01-08 15:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374426, 626570, 88004, '<td valign="top">Cropped a little too tight above the flame. Otherwise excellent. Great low light image!</td>', 'Cropped a little too tight above the flame. Otherwise excellent. Great low light image!', '2008-01-08 15:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4374430, 626728, 88004, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective! Great capture!</td>', 'Simple and effective! Great capture!', '2008-01-08 15:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
