(4378708, 625979, 27133, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on first place.  So you are saying that you got it right the first time...lol!  Good work.</td>', 'Congratulations on first place.  So you are saying that you got it right the first time...lol!  Good work.', '2008-01-09 17:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378731, 626600, 18080, '<td valign="top">nice idea but shots like this rarely score well.<br/>Colours seen over saturated.<br/>Keep shooting!<br/>But congrats on the brown ribbon.<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'nice idea but shots like this rarely score well.Colours seen over saturated.Keep shooting!But congrats on the brown ribbon. Kev', '2008-01-09 17:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378753, 625979, 32345, '<td valign="top">Congratulation Tim, this is a great picture. Well deserved Blue Ribbon :)</td>', 'Congratulation Tim, this is a great picture. Well deserved Blue Ribbon :)', '2008-01-09 18:00:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4378947, 625979, 56658, '<td valign="top">Great job Tim!</td>', 'Great job Tim!', '2008-01-09 18:52:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4379155, 625979, 66952, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best match shot I''ve seen, either on DPC or elsewhere. Congrats!</td>', 'I think this is the best match shot I''ve seen, either on DPC or elsewhere. Congrats!', '2008-01-09 19:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4379172, 625979, 14986, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Excellent shot and gives an idea for something to try with one of my PaD shots.</td>', 'Congratulations!  Excellent shot and gives an idea for something to try with one of my PaD shots.', '2008-01-09 19:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4379212, 628451, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nothing at all against Tim''s shot, but I would have picked this for first because it is so intense and dramatic.  The exposure on the flames just seems perfect to me and it was at just the right time of the evening.  Superb!  And a huge hug and congrats on that ribbon!!</td>', 'Nothing at all against Tim''s shot, but I would have picked this for first because it is so intense and dramatic.  The exposure on the flames just seems perfect to me and it was at just the right time of the evening.  Superb!  And a huge hug and congrats on that ribbon!!', '2008-01-09 20:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4379252, 628451, 2333, '<td valign="top">Wow, Laurie... love the reduced exposure, keeping all that detail in the flames and putting focus right there. The mood this dark image creates is really powerful. Love it.</td>', 'Wow, Laurie... love the reduced exposure, keeping all that detail in the flames and putting focus right there. The mood this dark image creates is really powerful. Love it.', '2008-01-09 20:19:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4379537, 626529, 57882, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MonicaJames:</b></div><hr/><i> I find it fascinating that the 4th is titled "Belvedere Under Fire" ^_^<br/>I thought my eyesight is getting poor and misaligned. <br/> <br/>Congratulations on being the 5th! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just noticed that.  How freaky.</td>', 'Originally posted by MonicaJames: I find it fascinating that the 4th is titled "Belvedere Under Fire" ^_^I thought my eyesight is getting poor and misaligned.  Congratulations on being the 5th!   Just noticed that.  How freaky.', '2008-01-09 21:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
