(4381104, 625979, 50034, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Blue Ribbon!  Excellent colors with no "blow-outs" in a subject that invariably creates them!  Tip-of-the-Hat to someone with great skill from someone who hopes to learn them!  Blessings!  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-10 11:44:19.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on your Blue Ribbon!  Excellent colors with no "blow-outs" in a subject that invariably creates them!  Tip-of-the-Hat to someone with great skill from someone who hopes to learn them!  Blessings!  :)', '2008-01-10 11:43:53.000000', '2008-01-10 11:44:19.000000', 0),
