(4384458, 628037, 67697, '<td valign="top">What I love about your work Sandy, is that not only do you take spectacular photos, but you also have amazing stories to go with them.  First, what a nut you are to have gone out to a FIRE at 1AM.  But what a sad story that goes with it too.  Did you ever find out what happened to his livestock?</td>', 'What I love about your work Sandy, is that not only do you take spectacular photos, but you also have amazing stories to go with them.  First, what a nut you are to have gone out to a FIRE at 1AM.  But what a sad story that goes with it too.  Did you ever find out what happened to his livestock?', '2008-01-11 09:57:03.000000', NULL, 0),
